WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Step 1: Assign the receiving manager under Edit location → Managers.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Step 2: Give that account Home, View stock transfers and Receive stock transfers permissions.

3
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Step 3: With the receiving location selected, open Home and choose Review transfer in the pending panel.

4
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Step 4: Check every item and choose Approve receipt only when the stock has arrived.
